OL,3,CEdinburgh Fringe opens as organisers
OL,4,Ccall on audiences to 'mix it up'
OL,6,FThe 2026 Edinburgh Fringe festival
OL,7,Fopened on Friday, with the organisers
OL,8,Fcalling on audiences to "mix it up"
OL,9,Fand jump into the thousands of shows
OL,10,Fon offer over the next four weeks.
OL,12,FThere are more than 4,202 shows
OL,13,Fawaiting audiences across 299 venues
OL,14,Fin the Scottish capital and artists
OL,15,Fwill undertake in excess of 57,000
OL,16,Fperformances across the month.
OL,18,FThe Fringe Society, which supports and
OL,19,Fpromotes the festival, said the
OL,20,Faverage ticket price at the Edinburgh
OL,21,FFringe this year is #13.
OL,26,@pD@YOUpD@cO]
