OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786061888
OL,3,CEdinburgh Fringe opens as organisers
OL,4,Ccall on audiences to 'mix it up'
OL,6,FThere are also 430 free shows being
OL,7,Fstaged across the festival in addition
OL,8,Fto 796 pay-what-you-want or pay-what-
OL,9,Fyou-can shows.
OL,11,FThe society added that a total of 74
OL,12,Fcountries will be represented across
OL,13,Fthe Edinburgh Fringe this year.
OL,15,FAs the festival season officially
OL,16,Flaunched on Friday, Tony Lankester,
OL,17,Fchief executive of the Edinburgh
OL,18,FFestival Fringe Society, encouraged
OL,19,Faudiences to jump in and buy a ticket.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/5
