OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786061888
OL,3,CEdinburgh Fringe opens as organisers
OL,4,Ccall on audiences to 'mix it up'
OL,6,FHe said: "To everyone taking part, the
OL,7,Fkey message is to enjoy this unique
OL,8,Fexperience. The Edinburgh Fringe is
OL,9,Fone of the greatest spectacles of
OL,10,Fperforming arts and culture, and you
OL,11,Fare the heart of it.
OL,13,F"This year we encourage audiences to
OL,14,Fmix it up and fully jump into the
OL,15,Fkaleidoscopic variety of performances
OL,16,Fon offer. The best way to support all
OL,17,Fartists, from established names to
OL,18,Fthose making their Fringe debut, is to
OL,19,Fbuy a ticket and attend a show."
OL,26,@nD@JOUuD@AOU{D@`O]
