OL,3,CEdinburgh Fringe opens as organisers
OL,4,Ccall on audiences to 'mix it up'
OL,6,FMr Lankester also thanked the artists,
OL,7,Fvenues, producers, promoters and
OL,8,Fothers who have worked to bring this
OL,9,Fyear's festival to life.
OL,11,F"Without your creativity and
OL,12,Fcommitment, the Fringe simply would
OL,13,Fnot be what it is today," he added.
OL,15,FThe Edinburgh Fringe officially
OL,16,Flaunched on Friday and will run until
OL,17,FMonday August 31.
OL,26,@sD@AOUuD@YO]
