OL,3,CEdinburgh Fringe opens as organisers
OL,4,Ccall on audiences to 'mix it up'
OL,6,FThe Fringe Street Events programme
OL,7,Fwill run daily from 11am on Friday
OL,8,Funtil August 30 across the Royal Mile
OL,9,Fand Mound area, with performers
OL,10,Fshowcasing their skills throughout the
OL,11,Fday.
OL,13,FAudiences can explore shows and
OL,14,Ftickets on edfringe.com and in the
OL,15,Fofficial Fringe app.
